&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Lead Product Storytelling:&amp;nbsp;Drive the end-to-end creative process for global product launches — from early-stage narrative concept through to final digital execution and delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;Be Hands-On with Craft:&amp;nbsp;Maintain an active, hands-on approach where needed, sitting alongside designers to guide UI, interaction design, and visual craft at key execution moments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
